{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56844","headline":"千岁宝掌和尚临灭示徒慧云偈 · 不详","name":"千岁宝掌和尚临灭示徒慧云偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本来无生死，今亦示生死。\n我得去住心，他生复来此。\n（同前）（按：二书云千岁宝掌和尚爲中印度人，生於周威烈王十二年。\n魏晋时东游至中国，时已六百余岁。\n梁时曾晤达摩而开悟。\n复遍历江浙名山，贞观十五年返飞来。\n显庆二年卒，他们一千七十二。\n其事显然出于附会，唐人着作及较早的几部灯录亦不载，似只能视爲小说家言，姑录附此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56844.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56844","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}